<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Yuda, yapeyilwe lina lyo bu'kana na lina lya mwandiki wake. Yuda aitapite mwene panga ywembe nnongo wa Yakobi na ywaabile nnongo wa Bwana Yesu. Kwa nyo ayu' Yuda kai' au'bi'li'ka panga yumo ywa alongo analu'me ba Bwana Yesu (Yuda 1). Tutangiteli panga balua yi'no yabinilwe kukanisa limo bai, lakini bu'kana na ngu'mbu'ku'mbu' yambone ya Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu', ibonekana panga balu'a yi', kuutumbwo, munomuno yaali'ngite Ayahudi. Ata nnyo balua yake ili'nga, “kwa abo babakemilwe, babapendilwe na Tati' Nnu'ngu' no kotelwa kwa kitumbu sa Yesu Kilisitu.” (1) Yendawesekana panga balua yi' yaandikilwe mumwaka wa 60 bu'ka po belekwa Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Libinio lyo andika balua yake kwa Akilisitu boti lyaai kwakwi'li'ka kanebaobeyelwe na balimu ba ubu'su' (4). Atumya ngu'mbu'ku'mbu' ya makowe gagapitike mu Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu' na maawanikiyo gake li'nga kulikangamaya likowe. Balua yi' ipanga kiselele na maganiyo gagabile gambone na galu' ga balua ya 2 Petili ibile pamope na makwi'li'ko kati ga balimu ba ubu'su' (4, 2 Petili 2:1). Maganiyo ga, gaipanga ngu'mbu'ku'mbu' yaibu'kana na malaika na miyi ya Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yuda autubiya asomi bake baali'ngite (1-2).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Apiya kitumbu sa kwaandikya nasembe nga sa kwakwi'li'ka bu'kana na itiso ya balimu ba ubu'su' (3-4).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Apiya mipwano bu'ka kwa bandu na gagapitike mu Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu' (5-16).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abakia mwaipwaika bayi'ki'ti ago makwi'li'ko gabapeyelwa (17-23).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ayomolya balua yake kwa kunnumba Nnu'ngu' (24-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Nenga na Yuda, nantumisi wa Yesu Kilisitu, na nnongowe Yakobi, nimwandikyanga mwenga mwamukemilwe na Tati' Nnu'ngu' na mwamutama muupendo wake no li'ndi'li'lwa kwa kitumbu sa Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ninnu'bya kiya, amani na upendo wambone ube kwinu.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balimu ba ubu'su'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Mwamambwiga bangu', niminyikiage muno kumwandikyanga bu'kana na ukosopoli watupanga nawo kiselele twenga twaboti. Lakini nibweni panga nipalikwa kumwandikya balua yi'no, li'nga kunnu'ba panga mukasane kwili'ndi'la imani yi'lu' Nnu'ngu' yaapei apeleteu bake mala yimo bai kwa nsimu woti. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Kwa mwanjaa kubile na bandu babaiyingiye kwa iyo pakati yinu, bandu babaandikilwe ukumu yi'no bu'ka tokyaa, alau babagalambwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' kwa kwipeya uulu wo panga malau, kabankana ywembe ywabile kolongosi na Bwana witu wa kisake, Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Pamope no panga muyomwike tanga makowe aga goti, nipala ninku'mbu'ki'ye panga Bwana aakosopoli bandu bake bu'ka kunni'ma wa Misili, lakini bu'ka po, aalangamise balu' babaakotwike kumwu'bi'lya. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Kai' mukumbuki malaika babaakotwike yi'mi'li'ka utawala wabe, na kwileka itamo yabe. Nnu'ngu' aatabi mulubi'ndu' kwa minyololo yaikangamile. Akwo bali'nda lisu'ba li'lu' lyo ukumilwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Nyinyonyo Sodoma na Gomola na mili'ma yi'lu' ya mbwega yake, bandu bo baapangite kati balu' malaika, baaipulaise kwa upege no bi'ngi'ya maminyikiyo mbali'mbali' ga yi'ga, ngabapeyelwa ukumu ya mwoto wa milele, ibe likwi'li'ko kwa bandu bi'ngi'.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Nyinyonyo na balimu bo ba ubu'su', balongoyelwa na maloto gabe kwisapuya yi'ga yabe bene kwa sambi. Baikana amuli ya utawala wowoti na kwatukana malaika apeleteu bababile kunani. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Ata Mikaeli malaika nku'lu' aapangiteli nyo. Mumataukano gake na Ibilisi bu'kana na yi'ga ya Musa, Mikaeli aalowiteli kupulu kwa kumukumu Ibilisi, ila aabaite, “Nnu'ngu' mwene na akukalipi!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Lakini bandu ba bagatukana makowe gangali kugatanga. Na kwa galu' makowe gabagatanga, bagatanga kwa uyu'yu'u nga kati inyama yangali malango, ago nga gagaalangamisa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Baakibona, kwa mwanjaa babi'ngiye ndi'la ya Kaini. Kwa kitumbu so pata mali, batu'mbwike mulikosa lyaapangite Balaamu. Balangamiswe kwa kitumbu sa ulau kati Kora mwaapangite ulau. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Ika kwabe kuleta atali yaiiyilwe mumakalamu ginu ga upendo. Baili'lya bene bai pangali kwibona oni. Bembe nga kati maunde gagaku'ngu'lu'ka na nsunga pangali leta ula, nga kati mikongo yangali pambika itunda ata ikatei nsimu wa mauno, nga mikongo yaiyokolilwe no waa mpamo. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bandu bo nga kati mabi'mbi' makali' ga baali, na iyendo yabe ya oni ibile kati matutume ga mabi'mbi' go. Bembe nga kati ndondwa yaityangatyanga kunani, Nnu'ngu' aabi'ki pandu pene lubi'ndu' lwa totolo batame mo milele.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Na Enoki, mundu ywa saba bu'ka mulubelekwo lwa Adamu, aatilondwa bu'kana na bandu bo kabaya, “Lingulya, Bwana endaisa pamope na maelupu kwa maelupu ga malaika bake apeleteu, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />li'nga kwaukumu bandu boti na kwapwatya babapanga sambi boti kwa iyendo yabe ndau, pamope na milongelo milau yoti yabaalongei bu'kana na Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Bandu ba saa yoti bendaku'ku'li'ka muno, no pala makosa ga bandu bi'ngi', bembe bakota maminyikio gabe manyatau na kwilumba muno, no longela makowe ga kwapulaisa bandu kwa kitumbu sa pwaila yabe bene.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makwi'li'ko na malagyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Lakini muku'mbu'ki galu' gamubakiyilwe kwai'mbu' na atumilwe ba Bwana Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Kwa mwanjaa mwaabakiyilwe panga, “Masu'ba ga kuundi'la kwaalu'a pitya na bandu bakunsalanga, babaalu'a kota maminyikio gabe bene malau.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Bandu bo ngabaleta malekangano, bagania makowe ga dunia bai, wala Loo wa Nnu'ngu' ntu'pu' nkati yabe. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Lakini mwenga mwaapendwa bangu', mwiikangamaye muimani yinu yaibile mbeleteu muno, na mulu'be kwa uweso wa Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Muyendeli muupendo wa Nnu'ngu', ku'no kamuyendelya pi'kanilya kwa pulaa kiya sa Bwana witu Yesu, li'nga annete muukoto wangayomoka.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mube na mwoyo wa kiya kwa balu' bababile na kyukala. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Bi'ngi' mwakosopoli kwa kwatu'ndu'bi'ya bu'ka mumwoto, na bi'ngi' mwabi'ki kiya, lakini mwiilinguli na kwibi'ka kuutalu na ulau wabe woti.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sala yo lumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Kwake ywembe ywawesa kunni'ndi'la mwenga mwaakane tu'mbu'ka na kunneta nnu'ngi' ya utukupu wake nku'lu', mubile na pulaa ngu'lu' pangali ulau. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Mwene nga Nnu'ngu' kisake, ywabile nkosopoli witu pi'tya kwa Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu. Nnu'ngu' alumbilwe muno, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngabile na utukupu, uku'lu', makakala na utawala tumbulya kwai'mbu', nambi'yambi' na mpaka milele. Amina.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>